s.com/\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/spindoctorsband\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/spindoctorsband\n\nSubscribe to Spin Doctors on YouTube: http://smarturl.it/SDrSub?IQid=SDr2P\n\n---------\n\nLyrics:\n\nOne, two princes kneel before you \nThat what I said now \nPrinces, princes who adore you \nJust go ahead now \nOne has diamonds in his pockets \nThat's some bread, now \nThis one said he wants to buy you rockets \nAin't in his head, now \n\nThis one he got a princely racket \nThat's what I said now \nGot some Big Seal upon his jacket \nAin't in his head now \nYou marry him, your father will condone you \nHow 'bout that now \nYou marry me, your father will disown you \nHe'll eat his hat, now \n\nMarry him, marry me \nI'm the one that loved you baby can't you see? \nAin't got no future or family tree \nBut I know what a prince and lover ought to be \nI know what a prince and lover ought be", "channel_id": "UCgWlDdj6-5cwPraD8KdShLw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgWlDdj6-5cwPraD8KdShLw", "duration": 260, "view_count": 142115117, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wsdy_rct6uo", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["acoustic", "funk rock", "music", "You've Got to Believe in Something", "Mark White", "instrumental", "Two Princes hd", "Two Princes live", "blues rock", "Rock", "vevo", "jam rock", "Chris Barron", "Turn It Upside Down", "official", "download", "Here Comes the Bride", "Two Princes hq", "Two Princes cover", "Aaron Comess", "karaoke", "remix", "spin doctors", "lyrics", "audio", "official video", "cover", "Pocket Full of Kryptonite", "Sony", "Eric Schenkman", "music video", "playlist", "single", "album", "live", "guitar lesson", "Two Princes"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api